name = "III"
img = ExtResource("1_jo3s3")
info = "[center]
Ok at first this character was meant as a joke, i didn't even made this drawing when i made him but something about his name was just funny to me \"Herald Tango\", a stupid and random name i thought first when i asked myself what to name this character.
So after taking a liking to him i decided to draw him and this was what i could think of, it not perfect since I'm still a beginner in this whole art stuff but it gets the point across, because of him the lore of combat trainer became a thing, a group of individual with registered license to be able to train and help people with combat drills. Think of it as a personal trainer in our own world.
[/center]"
